{"unit_id": "tag:00AM:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为一个开覆盖（covering）。设<MATH_0003>为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaves）、<SPACE_0001>代数结构（algebraic structures）层（sheaves）或<SPACE_0002><MATH_0004>-模（modules）层（sheaves）的粘合（glueing）数据，其中最后一种情形用到某个环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0005>，它定义在<MATH_0006>上。那么，上述引理<REF_0001>证明中的构造分别给出阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaf）、<SPACE_0003>代数结构（algebraic structures）层（sheaf）或<SPACE_0004><MATH_0007>-模（modules）层（sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指定底空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指定所取的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "第一种局部层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第一种粘合数据所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "第二种局部层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第二种粘合数据所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第三种局部层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第三种粘合数据所