{"unit_id": "tag:00AM:proof", "translation": "这是因为在该构造中，截面（sections）集合（set）<MATH_0001>取在开集（open）<MATH_0002>上，它由下列映射（maps）的等化子（equalizer）给出：\n<MATH_0003>\n在所考虑的每种情形中，这个等化子（equalizer）都给出相应范畴（category）中的一个对象（object），其底层集合（set）就是所引引理中考察的对象（object）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "构成所讨论集合的对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所述构造给出的截面集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指定截面所取的开集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于取等化子的映射"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "给出截面集合的构造"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "在各相应范畴中给出对象的构造"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "由各情形的取值结构确定"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "等化子在相应范畴中给出的对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "原文指定为该对象的底层集合"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "所引引理中考察的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:00AN:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为一个开覆盖（covering）。考虑将集合（sets）层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>对应到下列粘合（glueing）数据\n<MATH_0004>\n（相对于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>）的函子（functor）。它在<MATH_0006>与粘合（glueing）数据的范畴（category）之间给出一个范畴等价（equivalence of categories）。类似的陈述也分别适用于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）、<SPACE_0001>代数结构（algebraic structures）层（sheaves）和<SPACE_0002><MATH_0007>-模（modules）层（sheaves）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指定底空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指定所取的开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指定给定层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所述函子作用的对象"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "函子所给出的数据的类型"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "这些粘合数据所相对的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "把层对应到粘合数据的范畴间映射"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "限定目标范畴所含的数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "该函子的目标范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "断言所给函子在两个范畴间实现的关系"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "类似结论适用的第一种情形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "第二种情形下层所取值的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "类似结论适用的第二种层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第三种情形下层所取值的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "类似结论适用的第三种层"}], "notes": []}
